Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:12.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,吃的留下 下去吧\N{\fs40}Leave the food and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我大伯说 我必须为欺骗你的事向你诚挚道歉\N{\fs40}My uncle says I must beg your forgiveness for deceiving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:29.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你大伯？\N{\fs40}Your uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:31.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,贝勒王子\N{\fs40}Prince Baelor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:33.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,铁王座的继承人\N{\fs40}The heir to the Iron Throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:38.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 我不是有意骗你的 - 但你就是骗了\N{\fs40}- I never meant to lie. - Yeah, but you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.97,0:01:41.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,打从你名字开始 没一件是真的\N{\fs40}About everything, starting with your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:43.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我就没听说过什么伊戈王子\N{\fs40}I've not heard of a Prince Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:46.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 是伊耿的简称 - 当然是了\N{\fs40}- Short for Aegon. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.19,0:01:47.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,取自征服者？\N{\fs40}After the Conqueror?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:51.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,有多少个伊耿做过国王啊？\N{\fs40}How many Aegons have been king?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:54.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,四个 四个伊耿\N{\fs40}Four. Four Aegons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.87,0:01:59.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,所以你为何这么做？\N{\fs40}So why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是什么恶作剧吗？\N{\fs40}Was it some jape?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:05.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,就为了捉弄愚蠢的雇佣骑士？\N{\fs40}Make a fool of the stupid hedge knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不 我原本是要给戴伦当侍从的\N{\fs40}No. I was supposed to squire for Daeron.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:11.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他是我的长兄\N{\fs40}He's my older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他是个狗屎骑士 还是个醉鬼\N{\fs40}He's a shit knight, and a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.80,0:02:15.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,而且他压根儿就不想上场比武\N{\fs40}And he didn't want to enter the lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:21.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他打算让我俩藏在那间客栈里 一直到比武大会结束\N{\fs40}He only meant for us to hide in that inn until the tourney was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 你剃光了头 - 是戴伦剃的\N{\fs40}- You shaved your head. - It was Daeron who shaved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.27,0:02:26.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,也是戴伦告诉我你是个马童的吗？\N{\fs40}Was it Daeron that told me you were a stable boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.61,0:02:29.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 我没—— - 没什么？\N{\fs40}- I didn't-- - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:32.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我没觉得我干了什么不该干的事儿\N{\fs40}I didn't think I was doing anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:34.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你当然干了\N{\fs40}Of course, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:36.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,所以你才要说谎啊\N{\fs40}That's why you lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,别哭了\N{\fs40}Dry your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我发现去不了比武大会的时候实在太失望了——\N{\fs40}I was just so disappointed when I couldn't go to the tourney--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.59,0:02:51.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,噢 咱们可不能让小王子失望了 是吧？\N{\fs40}Oh, we can't have the little prince being disappointed now, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我只是想给人当侍从 爵士\N{\fs40}I just wanted to be somebody's squire, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:59.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那会儿要是有头驴缺侍从 你都会去伺候\N{\fs40}You'd have served a donkey, were it squire-less.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:02.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,对不起 爵士\N{\fs40}I'm sorry, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:04.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,真的对不起\N{\fs40}Truly am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:11.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,咱俩互相碰上了 也算是够倒霉的 不是吗？\N{\fs40}It's just a bit of bad luck we found each other, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:16.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他们打算怎么处置我 伊戈？\N{\fs40}What will they do with me, Egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.70,0:03:21.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我大伯想见你 等你吃完以后\N{\fs40}My uncle wants to see you after you're done eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:22.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那我现在吃完了\N{\fs40}I'm done now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:24.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我已经踹了一个王子的嘴\N{\fs40}I've already kicked one prince in the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.87,0:03:27.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不能再让另一个等\N{\fs40}Don't mean to keep another one waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:00.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,起来吧\N{\fs40}Rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:07.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,给邓肯爵士斟杯酒 伊耿\N{\fs40}Pour Ser Duncan a cup, Aegon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:10.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,注意别洒在人家身上\N{\fs40}Try not to spill it on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:15.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这孩子不会洒的 殿下\N{\fs40}The boy won't spill, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:18.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他是个好孩子\N{\fs40}He's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:22.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,好侍从 他对我并无恶意\N{\fs40}Good squire. And he meant no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:24.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我现下晓得了\N{\fs40}I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:26.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,纵无心为恶 所为亦足伤人\N{\fs40}One need not intend harm to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:30.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,伊耿目睹他哥哥对木偶师做出那种事之后\N{\fs40}Aegon should have come to me when he saw
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.19,0:04:32.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,就该直接来找我\N{\fs40}what his brother was doing to those puppeteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:34.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 当时来不及了 大伯 我—— - 可他反而跑去找你 邓肯爵士\N{\fs40}- There was no time, Uncle, I-- - Instead, he ran to you, Ser Duncan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:36.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那可称不上是在帮忙\N{\fs40}That was no kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:41.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我真希望邓肯爵士当时就杀了他\N{\fs40}I wish Ser Duncan had killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:43.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,伊利昂是你哥哥\N{\fs40}Aerion is your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:47.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,修士劝诫我们 兄弟之间要互相友爱\N{\fs40}And the septons say we must love our brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,伊耿 你先退下吧\N{\fs40}Aegon, leave us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,如您所愿 殿下\N{\fs40}As you will, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:09.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你作为骑士水平如何？\N{\fs40}How good a knight are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:12.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你的武艺怎样？\N{\fs40}How skilled at arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:16.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,阿兰爵士教会我使剑和盾\N{\fs40}Sir Arlan taught me sword and shield
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,还教我用长枪挑刺环靶\N{\fs40}and how to tilt at rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.83,0:05:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我弟弟梅卡数小时前回到城堡\N{\fs40}My brother Maekar returned to the castle a few hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:35.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,在此地以南一日骑程的客栈里 他找到了烂醉如泥的儿子戴伦\N{\fs40}He found his son Daeron drunk in an inn a day's ride to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 他告诉我弟弟\N{\fs40}- I know it. - He told my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.13,0:05:42.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,有个高大的强盗骑士掳走了伊耿\N{\fs40}that a huge robber knight made off with Aegon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:45.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,很不幸 他口中的强盗骑士就是你了 爵士\N{\fs40}I fear you have been cast as this robber knight, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:46.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他撒谎\N{\fs40}He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:49.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我四天前就离开那家客栈了\N{\fs40}I left that inn four nights past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:52.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,就算我掳走了他弟弟 戴伦王子也没来追啊\N{\fs40}Prince Daeron did not pursue his brother's captor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:53.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,看起来确实没有\N{\fs40}Seemingly not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:05:59.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那女孩呢？\N{\fs40}What of the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:01.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,等伊利昂再把故事添油加醋编一编\N{\fs40}By the time Aerion is done twisting the tale,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.49,0:06:02.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那就是叛国重罪\N{\fs40}it will be high treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:05.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,叛国？靠木偶戏？\N{\fs40}Treason? By puppetry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:07.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,龙毕竟是王室纹章\N{\fs40}The dragon is the sigil of the Royal House.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:09.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,演绎一条龙被屠杀……\N{\fs40}To portray one being slain...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这绝对是无心的\N{\fs40}It was surely innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,或许吧 但即便在太平年月 这也极不明智\N{\fs40}Perhaps, but far from wise, even in peacetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:17.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,伊利昂称此举为对坦格利安家族的含沙射影\N{\fs40}Aerion calls it a veiled attack on House Targaryen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,意在煽动叛乱\N{\fs40}an incitement to revolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,您相信这种说法吗 殿下？\N{\fs40}Do you believe that, Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:24.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,有一个事实无可争辩\N{\fs40}One truth is beyond dispute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:26.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你动手打了真龙血脉\N{\fs40}You laid hands upon the Blood of the Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:29.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那女孩的手指被生生掰断了\N{\fs40}The girl's finger was snapped in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:32.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,无论缘由为何 对王孙动手都绝非明智\N{\fs40}No matter the cause, it is never wise to strike a king's grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:34.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,换做是您 难道不会做同样的事吗？\N{\fs40}Would you not have done the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:35.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我或许会\N{\fs40}I might have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.73,0:06:38.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但我是七国太子 而非雇佣骑士\N{\fs40}But I'm a prince of the realm, not a hedge knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.57,0:06:41.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,难道不是所有的骑士都发过同样的誓言吗？\N{\fs40}Don't all knights make the same oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:45.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,保护无辜之人？\N{\fs40}To protect the innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,因为你的所作所为 伊利昂想要你的项上人头\N{\fs40}Aerion would like your head for what you did to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:04.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他不会如愿以偿 但我无法拒绝他的审判要求\N{\fs40}He will not have it, but I cannot deny him a trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.47,0:07:08.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,再加上戴伦指控你绑架伊戈\N{\fs40}And with Daeron's accusation that you kidnaped Egg,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:10.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,审判庭恐难偏向于你\N{\fs40}the court is unlikely to rule in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:12.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我被判有罪会怎样呢？\N{\fs40}And when I'm found guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:14.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,上次有人动手伤及王家血脉\N{\fs40}The last time a man struck the royal blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:16.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,惩罚是砍掉那只作案的手\N{\fs40}it was decreed he should lose the offending hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:19.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,而你还踢了他 记得吗？\N{\fs40}And you kicked him, too, did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:22.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fs40}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你还有另一个选择\N{\fs40}You have another choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:29.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是更好还是更糟 我难作断言\N{\fs40}Whether it is a better one or a worse, I cannot say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.87,0:07:33.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,所以 我再问你一遍 “高个”邓肯爵士\N{\fs40}And so, I ask you again, Ser Duncan the Tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.25,0:07:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你作为骑士 水平究竟如何？\N{\fs40}how good a knight are you, truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:08.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,嗯 比 比武审判\N{\fs40}Umm, t-trial by combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:12.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这是我的权利\N{\fs40}That is my right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我拒绝\N{\fs40}I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你不能拒绝\N{\fs40}You cannot refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:26.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,任何被指控有罪的骑士都有权如此要求\N{\fs40}Any knight accused of a crime has the right to demand as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,除非你要撤回指控？\N{\fs40}Unless you withdraw your claim?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:35.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,七子审判\N{\fs40}A trial of seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:42.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这是我的权利 我确信\N{\fs40}That is my right, I do believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:43.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,七子审判是他妈什么玩意儿？\N{\fs40}What the fuck is a trial of seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.49,0:08:51.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那是另一种形式的比武审判\N{\fs40}It is another form of trial by combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,历世久远 鲜有循用\N{\fs40}Ancient. Seldom invoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:59.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,随安达尔人与他们的七神横渡狭海而来\N{\fs40}It came across the Narrow Sea with the Andals and their seven gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:03.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,好吧 既然是安达尔人……\N{\fs40}Well, if it was the Andals...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:06.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我 我很抱歉 殿下\N{\fs40}I-I'm sorry, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:09.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,老人家向来不大在意信仰祈祷之事\N{\fs40}The old man was never much for praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:12.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,什么是七子审判？\N{\fs40}What is a trial of seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:16.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,安达尔人相信 若令七对武士交手\N{\fs40}The Andals believed that if seven champions fought,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:18.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,会更荣耀诸神 让诸神更愿意干预\N{\fs40}the gods, being thus honored, would be more like to intervene
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:21.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,使有罪者受惩\N{\fs40}and see the guilty party punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:30.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你缩在这种六千年前的安达尔蠢规矩后面\N{\fs40}Are you cowering behind some 6,000-year-old Andal foolery
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.61,0:09:34.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,难道是怕了和这雇佣骑士单挑不成？\N{\fs40}because you're afraid to face this hedge knight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:35.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 那是为什么？\N{\fs40}- No. - Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:38.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,为什么不亲手宰了这无赖？\N{\fs40}Why not slay the rogue yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,戴伦也同样受到了冒犯\N{\fs40}Daeron has been wronged as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,邓肯爵士对我们犯下的每一条罪 都必须付出代价\N{\fs40}Ser Duncan must pay for each one of his crimes against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,难道我们该容忍坦格利安家族的荣誉蒙尘吗？\N{\fs40}Or would we leave a matter of Targaryen honor in doubt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,别跟我提荣誉 小子\N{\fs40}Do not speak to me of honor, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:55.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这他妈纯属胡扯\N{\fs40}This is fucking nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:56.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fs40}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.01,0:09:59.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不见得\N{\fs40}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:09.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,伊利昂有这个权利 我们别无选择\N{\fs40}Aerion is within his rights. We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:13.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,黎明时分将举行七子审判\N{\fs40}A trial of seven must be held at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:17.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,什么意思？我必须和七个人打？\N{\fs40}What does that mean? That I must fight seven men?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:18.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,少装蒜了\N{\fs40}Do not play the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:20.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,七子审判必须以七对七\N{\fs40}It must be seven against seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你得再找六位骑士为你而战\N{\fs40}You must find six other knights to fight beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,可我连一个也没有\N{\fs40}But I have no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,若你的诉求正义 必然有人为你而战\N{\fs40}If a cause is just, good men will fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.67,0:10:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,如若没有 自然就证明你有罪\N{\fs40}If not, it will be because you are guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:44.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,给我过来\N{\fs40}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:55.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,蠢货！\N{\fs40}Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:01.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我能走了吗？\N{\fs40}Can I go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:10.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,去寻找你的战士吧 邓肯爵士\N{\fs40}Seek your champions, Ser Duncan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,哦 小家伙们\N{\fs40}Oh, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这下我全搞砸了\N{\fs40}I've mucked it up this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 我明天就要死了 - 邓克！\N{\fs40}- I think I'm gonna die tomorrow. - Dunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:54.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是你吗？你还活着！\N{\fs40}Is that you? You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:02.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,雷蒙 谢谢你帮忙照看我的——\N{\fs40}Raymun, thank you for watching my--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:03.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你饿吗？\N{\fs40}Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:06.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 不 不饿  - 来吧\N{\fs40}- No, not really. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:11.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 乖！ - 你刚刚在跟马讲话吗？\N{\fs40}- Whoa! - Were you talking to your horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.11,0:12:13.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 太神经了吧\N{\fs40}- Yeah. - That's fucking mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:17.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,七子审判\N{\fs40}Trial of seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:21.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,邓肯 那就意味着会用上战斧 流星锤和真正的战枪\N{\fs40}Duncan, that means battleaxes, morningstars, and lances of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:23.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 抱歉\N{\fs40}- I know what it means. - I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:25.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我这堂弟向来胆小如鼠\N{\fs40}Seems cousin here has milk in his veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:28.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 去你的吧 我只是——  - 这是骑士间的较量 雷蒙\N{\fs40}- Oh, fuck off, I just meant-- - This is knightly combat, Raymun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:30.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,既然你并非骑士 自然不会有性命之忧\N{\fs40}As you are no knight, your skin is not at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:36.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看见了伊利昂对木偶艺人们的所作所为\N{\fs40}I saw what Aerion did to those puppeteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:39.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,所有骑士都发誓保护无辜之人\N{\fs40}All knights vow to protect the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.01,0:12:41.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,雇佣骑士也包括在内\N{\fs40}Even hedge knights, I assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:45.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我挺你\N{\fs40}I'm for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.27,0:12:50.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,感谢您 爵士\N{\fs40}Thank you, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.11,0:12:57.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 您不必这样做的 - 虽然我很不爽\N{\fs40}- Perhaps you shouldn't. - It pains me to admit it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:58.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但必须承认史蒂芬是使剑的好手\N{\fs40}but Steffon's a fine sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:01.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 这有什么让你不爽的？ - 我对此毫不怀疑\N{\fs40}- Why would that pain you? - I don't doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.95,0:13:04.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但是龙家不会轻易放过跟他们对着干的人\N{\fs40}But the Dragon House will not look kindly on those who oppose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.53,0:13:05.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,龙家？\N{\fs40}Dragon House?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他们的龙在哪儿呢 邓肯爵士？\N{\fs40}Where are their dragons, Ser Duncan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们佛索威家扎根于此\N{\fs40}Us Fossoways, we were here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,远早于这些异族人踏足我们的海岸\N{\fs40}long before these others come to our shores.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,而且我保证 他们走后我们仍会长久地留在这里\N{\fs40}And I'll warrant we'll be here long after they are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 还有谁跟我们一道出战？ - 我谁也不认识\N{\fs40}- Who else fights with us? - I know no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:26.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们肯定还能再找到五个愿意被歌手们永远传唱的好人\N{\fs40}I'm sure we can find five more good men who wish singers to make them immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:31.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我不明白为何悲剧总是追随那些正直之人\N{\fs40}I do not know why tragedy so oft follows after honorable men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:34.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但当答案难觅之时\N{\fs40}But when I find myself without the answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:36.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,追寻荣耀总是对的\N{\fs40}the answer is always "more glory."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,算你走运 我还算有些朋友\N{\fs40}Lucky for you, I have some friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.95,0:13:42.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,莱昂诺爵士 兰尼斯特大人 奥瑟爵士\N{\fs40}Ser Lyonel, Lord Lannister, Ser Otho.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.99,0:13:45.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他们不会喜欢被人半夜吵醒的\N{\fs40}They won't be happy at being woken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:46.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那他们就会打得更卖力 就像被惹毛了的獾子一样\N{\fs40}Then they'll fight like pestered badgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.37,0:13:50.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,有我在你不会死的 爵士\N{\fs40}You shan't die under my watch, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fs40}I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:20.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,雷蒙 你觉得你堂哥能把他说的那些人带回来吗？\N{\fs40}Raymun, do you think your cousin can bring the men he speaks of?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:22.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fs40}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:26.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,逃跑也许是个好主意\N{\fs40}You may be wise to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:29.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,如果我跑了 他们会杀了我吧？\N{\fs40}Won't they kill me if I run?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:30.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你不跑他们就不杀你了？\N{\fs40}Won't they kill you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,也许诸神认为这是我活该\N{\fs40}Maybe the gods figure this is what I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,就因为你做了正确的事吗？\N{\fs40}For doing what you were supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,因为我认不清自己的地位\N{\fs40}For not knowing my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:50.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 爵士 - 伊戈！\N{\fs40}- Ser. - Egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:52.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你来干什么？\N{\fs40}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:56.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我是您的侍从 爵士 您需要有人为您穿戴盔甲\N{\fs40}I'm your squire, ser. You'll need someone to arm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:15:00.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你父亲知道你离开了城堡吗？\N{\fs40}Does your father know you've left the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,最好别让他知道\N{\fs40}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:07.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我今晚可受不了再挨一顿鞭子抽脚心了\N{\fs40}I don't think I could bear another foot whipping tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:13.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 是你！ - 不！不 邓肯 别！\N{\fs40}- You! - No! No, Duncan, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:15.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,住手！求你了！\N{\fs40}Stop! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你疯了不成 竟敢来这里？\N{\fs40}Are you mad coming here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我应该捅穿你的脖子\N{\fs40}I should drive this through your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,倒不如你给我倒杯好酒吧\N{\fs40}I'd sooner you pour me a cup of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,去你妈的酒 你撒谎害了我！\N{\fs40}Fuck your wine. You lied about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:26.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,唉 家父来质问我伊戈的去向\N{\fs40}Well, I had to say something when my father
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:28.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我总得说点什么吧\N{\fs40}demanded to know where Egg had gotten to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:31.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,求您了 别伤害他\N{\fs40}Please, don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.77,0:15:36.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,反正也是个死\N{\fs40}He can't kill me twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:40.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我父亲要加入控方七子 爵士\N{\fs40}My father's going to join the seven accusers, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:43.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,对 当然了 他得挽回儿子们的荣誉\N{\fs40}Yeah, of course he will. He must redeem his sons' honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:45.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我可没什么荣誉需要挽回\N{\fs40}Not that I ever asked to have my honor redeemed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:48.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,谁要就拿走 我根本就不在乎\N{\fs40}Whoever has it can keep it, so far as I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:50.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我恳求他别这么做 爵士 我求过他了\N{\fs40}I begged him not to, ser. I begged him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:54.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不论如何 你大可不必担心我\N{\fs40}For what it's worth, you have little to fear from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我会在第一回合尽可能显得很英勇\N{\fs40}and I'll do my best to look gallant in the first charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:16:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,然后嘛 也许你可以给我漂亮地来一下\N{\fs40}But after that, perhaps you could strike me a nice blow
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,照着头盔侧面来\N{\fs40}to the side of the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:04.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,弄出点声音 但也别太响\N{\fs40}Make it ring. Not too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:06.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你来这就为了说这个？\N{\fs40}Is that all you came here to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:12.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我父亲已经下令让御林铁卫上场\N{\fs40}My father has commanded the Kingsguard to fight as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:17.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,只有在此地的三位而已\N{\fs40}Only the three that are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:18.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,您这边有谁 爵士？\N{\fs40}Who do you have, ser?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:21.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,雷蒙的堂哥\N{\fs40}Raymun's cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.99,0:16:30.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我可以找人 爵士 我能调动一些骑士\N{\fs40}I can bring people, ser. Knights. I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.91,0:16:33.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我可是要对付你们家族啊\N{\fs40}I'll be fighting against your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他们会保护好我父亲 而且您又不会杀了戴伦\N{\fs40}My father will be well guarded, and you won't kill Daeron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.33,0:16:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他说了会主动倒地的\N{\fs40}He told you he'd fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,还有伊利昂呢\N{\fs40}And Aerion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你愿意看他死吗？\N{\fs40}You'd see him dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我还很小的时候\N{\fs40}When I was little,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:51.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,伊利昂会在夜里溜进我的卧房\N{\fs40}Aerion used to come into my bed chamber at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:53.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,拿匕首顶住我双腿之间\N{\fs40}put his knife in between my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:55.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他说他有太多兄弟\N{\fs40}He had too many brothers, he'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:58.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,也许某天晚上 他就兴起让我做他妹妹 然后娶我\N{\fs40}Maybe one night, he'd make me his sister. Then he could marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.98,0:17:04.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,抱歉 那也太······\N{\fs40}Sorry, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:06.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,伊戈说得没错\N{\fs40}Egg has the truth of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,伊利昂是个怪物\N{\fs40}Aerion can be quite the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:10.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他还把我的猫丢进了井里\N{\fs40}And he threw my cat in the well, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.03,0:17:12.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 他说他没干 但就是他干的  - 好了\N{\fs40}- He says he didn't, but he did. - Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他总以为自己是化身人形的龙\N{\fs40}He thinks he's a dragon in human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:18.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,所以看见那场木偶戏才失控了\N{\fs40}That's why he was so wroth at the puppet show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,真遗憾他没生在佛索威家族\N{\fs40}A pity he wasn't born a Fossoway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,那他就会以为自己是个苹果 我们大家都安全多了\N{\fs40}Then he'd think himself an apple and we'd all be a deal safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我得赶紧溜回城堡了\N{\fs40}I must steal back to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,邓肯爵士？\N{\fs40}Ser Duncan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:31.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,借一步说话？\N{\fs40}Private word?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:51.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我梦见了你\N{\fs40}I dreamed of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:54.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,您说过了\N{\fs40}You said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:58.41,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 在旅馆的时候 - 我说过？\N{\fs40}- At the inn. - Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,好吧 我的梦和你们的不同\N{\fs40}Well, my dreams are not like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.25,0:18:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我的梦会成真\N{\fs40}Mine come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.13,0:18:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,加诸于平凡之人的非凡天赋\N{\fs40}An impressive talent for an unimpressive man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,命运的又一个小玩笑\N{\fs40}Another one of life's little ironies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:15.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但我看见了你 爵士\N{\fs40}But I have seen you, ser.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,还有火\N{\fs40}And a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:20.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,和一头死去的龙\N{\fs40}And a dead dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.27,0:18:28.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,一头庞然巨兽 翅膀如此宽阔 可以遮住这片草场\N{\fs40}A great beast with wings so large they could cover this meadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,它倒在了你身上\N{\fs40}It had fallen on top of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:34.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你活下来 龙却死了\N{\fs40}But you were alive, and the dragon was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.99,0:18:39.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我杀了它？\N{\fs40}Did I kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:43.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这我不清楚\N{\fs40}That I could not say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们曾是龙的主人\N{\fs40}We were dragon masters once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:51.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,真是难以置信\N{\fs40}Hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:53.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,现在龙绝了种 但我们还在\N{\fs40}Now, they're all gone, but we remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:18:58.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我今天不想死在今天\N{\fs40}I don't care to die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:03.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我也不想死\N{\fs40}I don't care to die either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:10.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,也许我的谎言会害死你\N{\fs40}It may be that I've killed you with my lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:12.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,倘若如此 我很抱歉\N{\fs40}And if so, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:16.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我自知不免堕入地狱\N{\fs40}I'm doomed to some kind of hell, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.95,0:19:20.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,也许是没酒的那层\N{\fs40}Likely one without wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.97,0:19:36.76,旁白字幕,,0,0,0,,你不是骑士\N{\fs40}You are no knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:49.27,旁白字幕,,0,0,0,,你是傻瓜佛罗理安\N{\fs40}You are Florian the Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.55,0:20:14.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,邓肯爵士\N{\fs40}Ser Duncan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:19.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你是来取盾牌的吧 她把盾留给我了\N{\fs40}If you are come for your shield, she left it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:38.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,她人呢？\N{\fs40}Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:41.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他们去多恩了\N{\fs40}They make for Dorne.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.87,0:20:44.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,远走高飞 躲避风头\N{\fs40}Well gone is well forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.62,0:20:46.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,很明智\N{\fs40}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:06.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你的盾边旧了\N{\fs40}Your rim was old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:11.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,廉价旧铁 生了锈又易碎\N{\fs40}Cheap steel. Brittle and rusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.48,0:21:13.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,俺给你打了面新的\N{\fs40}I've made you a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:14.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,比以前厚两倍\N{\fs40}It's twice as thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.86,0:21:16.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,背后用皮带加固了\N{\fs40}I've put some straps on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:22.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,虽然现在沉了许多 但也结实得多\N{\fs40}It will be heavier now, but stronger too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:27.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,图是女孩画的\N{\fs40}The girl did the paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,流星在坠落\N{\fs40}The star is fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,落日意味着黑夜\N{\fs40}And the sunset heralds night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这面盾画得像预示着死亡\N{\fs40}The shield is all painted up like death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:44.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,可这榆树如此生机盎然 兄弟\N{\fs40}The elm's alive, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:48.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,看见它的枝叶多绿了吗？\N{\fs40}See how green the leaves are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:49.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这无疑是夏天的叶子\N{\fs40}That's summer leaves, for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.02,0:21:53.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你记得那首古老的盾牌四字歌不？\N{\fs40}You remember the old shield rhyme?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.32,0:21:59.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,橡木钢铁 护卫平安\N{\fs40}Oak and iron, guard me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.15,0:22:03.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,保我周全 不堕地狱\N{\fs40}Or else I'm dead and doomed to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:06.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs40}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:20.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,加上新盾边什么的 你总共收多少钱？\N{\fs40}How much do you want for the new rim and all?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.97,0:22:23.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你吗……\N{\fs40}From you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.89,0:22:26.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,一个铜板就够\N{\fs40}a copper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:05.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,各位爵士……\N{\fs40}Sers...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:08.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我永远欠你们的情\N{\fs40}I am in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.51,0:23:10.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是伊利昂欠我们\N{\fs40}The debt is Aerion's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.77,0:23:13.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们要找他讨回\N{\fs40}And we mean to collect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.35,0:23:16.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 听说您腿断了 - 没错\N{\fs40}- I had heard your leg was broken. - You heard true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.94,0:23:18.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我腿断了 下不了地\N{\fs40}My leg is broken, I cannot walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.82,0:23:23.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但只要能骑马 我就能战\N{\fs40}But so long as I can sit on a horse, I can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.57,0:23:25.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,罗宾爵士愿为国王忠诚奋战至死\N{\fs40}Ser Robyn would die the king's faithful servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.66,0:23:30.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但当王权与诸神对立之时 罗宾爵士站在诸神那边\N{\fs40}But when the crown goes against the gods, Ser Robyn goes against the crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:33.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我就知道你是个麻烦精\N{\fs40}I always knew you meant trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.83,0:23:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 真不知道怎么感谢您 - 哈\N{\fs40}- I cannot thank you enough. - Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.08,0:23:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,还有邀请诸位的史蒂芬爵士\N{\fs40}Nor Ser Steffon for bringing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.21,0:23:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,史提夫伦爵士是他妈哪位？是你的……\N{\fs40}Who the fuck is Ser Stevron? Your...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.96,0:23:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,……小男孩来找我的\N{\fs40}...boy found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.88,0:23:47.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,一百多年没举行七子审判了\N{\fs40}Hasn't been a trial of seven for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.09,0:23:49.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,能胖揍御林铁卫 给他们漂亮的白袍上点颜色\N{\fs40}I wasn't about to miss a chance to bloody up the Kingsguard
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.64,0:23:51.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我才不会错过这机会呢\N{\fs40}in their pretty white gowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.99,0:24:49.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,六人 他们也只有六个人\N{\fs40}Six. There are only six.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.91,0:24:51.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,难道伊利昂也找不到第七个骑士\N{\fs40}Is it possible Aerion has not found a seventh
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.87,0:24:53.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,来相助？\N{\fs40}to take up his claim?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.24,0:24:55.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,雷蒙！\N{\fs40}Raymun!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.24,0:24:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,快把我的头盔给我\N{\fs40}My helm, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.37,0:25:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,史蒂芬爵士 您请到朋友了吗？\N{\fs40}Ser Steffon, what of your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们只需一位骑士就能凑足七人\N{\fs40}We only need one more to make our seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.21,0:25:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,恐怕你还需两位\N{\fs40}I'm afraid you'll need two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.13,0:25:11.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我为伊利昂王子和控方而战\N{\fs40}I fight with Prince Aerion and the accusers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.56,0:25:18.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不 你……\N{\fs40}No, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.85,0:25:21.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,是你告诉邓肯爵士可以指望你的\N{\fs40}you told Ser Duncan to rely on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.35,0:25:24.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,要不是能挫败邓肯爵士\N{\fs40}Well, our prince would not have made me a lord elsewise,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.23,0:25:25.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,咱们王子殿下也不会提拔我做领主了\N{\fs40}but for it thwarted Ser Duncan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.07,0:25:31.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你为了身份出卖荣誉？\N{\fs40}You traded your honor for a lordship?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.95,0:25:33.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,好堂弟\N{\fs40}Cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.57,0:25:36.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,有些伟人出卖了荣誉 换来的还远不如这个呢\N{\fs40}I know great men who have traded their honor for far less.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.37,0:25:38.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这笔买卖划算得很\N{\fs40}It was a bargain well struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.50,0:25:41.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,把马给我牵来\N{\fs40}Fetch me my horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你自己牵去\N{\fs40}Get him yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.11,0:26:09.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们输定了\N{\fs40}We are lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.37,0:26:18.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,赐封我为骑士 让我来顶替我堂哥\N{\fs40}Knight me. I will take my cousin's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.21,0:26:24.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,邓肯爵士 请赐封我\N{\fs40}Ser Duncan, knight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.67,0:26:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,雷蒙 我不可以\N{\fs40}Raymun, I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.63,0:26:28.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,没有我 你们只有五个人\N{\fs40}Without me, you're only five.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:31.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,五个人是赢不了的\N{\fs40}You cannot win with five.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.97,0:26:36.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,恐怕这孩子说的对\N{\fs40}The lad has the truth of it, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.05,0:26:40.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,事不宜迟 邓肯爵士\N{\fs40}Go on, Ser Duncan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.02,0:26:41.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,任何骑士都能赐封骑士\N{\fs40}Any knight can make a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.41,0:26:57.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fs40}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.99,0:26:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我来赐封侍从雷蒙\N{\fs40}I shall give Squire Raymun his knighthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.09,0:27:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,以战士之名 我要求你勇敢\N{\fs40}In the name of the Warrior, I charge you to be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.27,0:27:26.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,以天父之名 我要求你公正\N{\fs40}In the name of the Father, I charge you to be just.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.07,0:27:34.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,以圣母之名……\N{\fs40}In the name of the Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.03,0:27:37.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我要求你保护弱者和无辜之人\N{\fs40}I charge you to protect the young and innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.63,0:27:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,邓肯爵士\N{\fs40}Ser Duncan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.05,0:27:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们不能再等了\N{\fs40}We cannot delay any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.05,0:27:57.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,- 你方好像才五人啊 - 六人\N{\fs40}- Seems you only have five champions. - Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.76,0:28:00.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,莱昂诺爵士正赐封雷蒙·佛索威\N{\fs40}Ser Lyonel is knighting Raymun Fossoway.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.10,0:28:01.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们将以六敌七\N{\fs40}We will fight you six against seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.72,0:28:03.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,恐怕这不可以吧\N{\fs40}I'm afraid it is not permitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.60,0:28:05.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,爵士 如果你找不到另一位骑士\N{\fs40}If you cannot find another knight to join you, ser,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.89,0:28:08.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,即证明你所受指控之罪名为实\N{\fs40}then you must be declared guilty of your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.90,0:28:13.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,大人 请再给我一点时间\N{\fs40}M'lord, I beg a moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.19,0:28:16.61,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fs40}You have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.52,0:28:48.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,大人们！\N{\fs40}M'lords!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.77,0:28:54.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我知道你们没有人记得铜分树村的阿兰爵士\N{\fs40}I know none of you remember Ser Arlan of Pennytree.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.53,0:28:57.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,但我曾是他的侍从\N{\fs40}But I was his squire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.32,0:29:01.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我们曾为您效劳\N{\fs40}We served many of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.66,0:29:06.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,在您桌边用餐\N{\fs40}Ate at your tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.25,0:29:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,在您厅堂休息\N{\fs40}Slept in your halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.54,0:29:15.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他是个好人\N{\fs40}He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.80,0:29:20.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,他教会我骑士之道\N{\fs40}And he taught me how to be a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.43,0:29:27.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,不仅是使枪弄剑 更在于荣誉\N{\fs40}Not just sword and lance, but honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.14,0:29:33.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,骑士保护无辜之人\N{\fs40}A knight defends the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.52,0:29:36.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,这是——这是我所践行之道\N{\fs40}That's-- that's all I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.61,0:29:46.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我和阿兰爵士并非血脉相连 但我以他为榜样\N{\fs40}I was not Ser Arlan's blood, but I have followed his example.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.58,0:29:50.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,正如您的儿子们会以您为榜样一样\N{\fs40}As your sons will follow yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.26,0:30:04.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,有谁愿意和我并肩作战？\N{\fs40}Who will stand and fight with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.44,0:30:22.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,屠夫布雷肯！\N{\fs40}The Brute of Bracken!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.73,0:30:58.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,维斯特洛的贵族世家难道已尽数丧失勇气？\N{\fs40}Has courage deserted the noble houses of Westeros?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.36,0:31:01.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我不相信！\N{\fs40}I will not believe it is so!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.70,0:31:09.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你们中就没有一位真正的骑士吗？！\N{\fs40}Are there no true knights among you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.47,0:31:35.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,我来加入邓肯爵士\N{\fs40}I will take Ser Duncan's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.12,0:31:50.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,你失去理智了吗？\N{\fs40}Have you taken leave of your senses?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.12,0:31:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,此人袭击我儿\N{\fs40}This man attacked my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.54,0:31:55.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,此人保护弱者\N{\fs40}This man protected the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.87,0:31:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,正如每位真正的骑士该做的那样\N{\fs40}As every true knight must.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.25,0:32:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,让诸神决定他是否有罪吧\N{\fs40}Let the gods decide if he was right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.88,0:32:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,驾！\N{\fs40}Hyah!
